WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:12.560
North East Derbyshire. A place where bustling&nbsp;
market towns meet rural beauty. All just a stone's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:18.720
throw from the Peak District National Park and the&nbsp;
nearby cities of Sheffield Nottingham and Derby.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:24.720
North East Derbyshire District Council is one&nbsp;
which listens and strives to do the best for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:30.560
its residents and businesses, working with&nbsp;
them to make informed important decisions&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:38.160
which aim to improve the quality of lives and&nbsp;
help us grow together. We pride ourselves in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:44.160
going above and beyond from emptying your&nbsp;
bins from rain or shine to offering support&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:52.160
helping local and independent businesses thrive&nbsp;
we're here for you. We run four fantastic leisure&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:57.360
centres in the district which are important&nbsp;
hubs for local communities in Dronfield,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:04.640
Eckington, Killamarsh and Clay Cross perfect&nbsp;
for an early morning swim or an evening cycle.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:11.840
We work closely with you - our communities - to&nbsp;
combat littering and fly-tipping taking strong&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:18.240
action against offenders and providing vital&nbsp;
funding to community groups and school projects.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:24.640
Our resources can help new entrepreneurs start&nbsp;
up their own business helping them gain access&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:30.080
to vital funds and resources. North East&nbsp;
Derbyshire could be the perfect place for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:39.840
large-scale businesses to relocate to with its&nbsp;
great road and rail links to nearby major cities.

00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:46.560
And that's not all. We are passionate about&nbsp;
helping you gain employment and providing the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.560 --> 00:01:52.880
training you need to have a successful career&nbsp;
by offering a tailored, bespoke service to help&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.880 --> 00:02:01.040
each and every one of our residents succeed moving&nbsp;
forward. We're continuing to enhance our digital&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:07.040
presence making ourselves more accessible online&nbsp;
so you can access the services you need when it's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:14.400
convenient for you. We're making positive changes&nbsp;
to local areas building affordable housing for our&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:22.800
families and seeking out new leisure opportunities&nbsp;
brought to you by the £24.1m towns fund deal.

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:31.360
We'll continue to work closely with partners to&nbsp;
deliver a healthier more sustainable future for us&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:38.880
all. We care about our planet. We're implementing&nbsp;
our climate change strategy as we seek to be a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:46.720
carbon neutral authority by 2030. We will help&nbsp;
you and your home become more energy efficient&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:53.200
through a number of green and sustainable schemes&nbsp;
saving you money in the process, however you may&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.200 --> 00:03:03.840
work interact or contact us via email telephone&nbsp;
or seeing us in person - we're here for you

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:14.080
We live and work in a beautiful district. Let's&nbsp;
enjoy it, protect it, and work together. We are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:20.800
North East Derbyshire District Council an&nbsp;
inclusive accessible and innovative council&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:25.440
breaking the mold and one which&nbsp;
prides itself on being there for you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:31.840
our North East Derbyshire the&nbsp;
gateway to the country and city

